&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;The scale, siting
and design of the proposed first-floor rear extension would result in an
unacceptable loss of daylight, overshadowing and overbearing impacts to the
residents at no.13 Charles Road. Therefore, the proposal would constitute
unneighbourly development which is contrary to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

